{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52059","headline":"阅家书 · 王绩","name":"阅家书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"张氏前钞本，班家旧赐余。\n尚应千许帙，何啻五盈车。\n缝悉龟文印，题皆龙爪书。\n牙签过半在，玉轴已全疎。\n蘖系防黏蠹，芸香辟纸鱼。\n下帷堪发愤，闭户足爲储。\n爲向扬雄说，无劳羡石渠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}